  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ravi Son Of Shri Subhash Chand vs State Of Rajasthan on 18 May, 2022 Author: Farjand Ali Bench: Farjand Ali High Court Of Judicature For Rajasthan Bench At Jaipur S.B. Criminal Miscellaneous Bail Application No. 7467/2022 Ravi Son Of Shri Subhash Chand, Resident Of Doongarpur, Police Station Sadar, Dholpur District Dholpur (Raj.) ( At Present In District Jail Dholpur) ----Petitioner Versus State Of Rajasthan, Through P.p. ----Respondent For Petitioner(s) : Mr. Dushyant Jain Mr. Udit Sopra For Respondent(s) : Mr. M S Saini, Pp Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Farjand Ali Order 18/05/2022 1.",
    "facts": "The instant bail application has been filed under Section 439 Cr.P.C. on behalf of accused-petitioner Ravi Son Of Shri Subhash Chand. The petitioner has been arrested in connection with FIR No. 160/2022 registered at Police Station Sadar Dholpur, District Dholpur for the offence(s) under Sections 272, 273 & 420 of IPC and Sections 26(2)(i) & 59(i) of Food Safety and Standard Act.",
    "arguments": "2. Learned counsel for the accused-petitioner submits that a false case has been foisted against the petitioner; he submits that Section 420 of IPC is not made out even if the allegation is taken in its entirety, the other offence are bailable. He is behind the bars since long time. No useful purpose would be served by keeping him behind the bars till disposal of the case.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "2. Learned counsel for the accused-petitioner submits that a false case has been foisted against the petitioner; he submits that Section 420 of IPC is not made out even if the allegation is taken in its entirety, the other offence are bailable. He is behind the bars since long time. No useful purpose would be served by keeping him behind the bars till disposal of the case.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
